[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3120.63, "timestamp": "00:52:00", "text": "意识到你只有一个鸡蛋，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3122.71, "timestamp": "00:52:02", "text": "你该怎么说呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3124.39, "timestamp": "00:52:04", "text": "听起来很像“哦，你加了”"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3124.577, "timestamp": "00:52:04", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Man my adhd can keep up with saiko I love this"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3125.829, "timestamp": "00:52:05", "text": "什么都做了，现在你却在抱怨。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3128.39, "timestamp": "00:52:08", "text": "听起来会是这样，但如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3130.309, "timestamp": "00:52:10", "text": "如果有图片，你就可以展示所有内容了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3132.87, "timestamp": "00:52:12", "text": "那句抱歉，我认得，就像我知道一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3135.109, "timestamp": "00:52:15", "text": "以后再说吧，现在我意识到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3137.109, "timestamp": "00:52:17", "text": "少了……至少有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3140.63, "timestamp": "00:52:20", "text": "总得拿出点东西来展示一下，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3142.95, "timestamp": "00:52:22", "text": "那个人，我的注意力缺陷多动症都能跟上他的节奏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3144.23, "timestamp": "00:52:24", "text": "精神病。我喜欢这个。非常感谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3146.71, "timestamp": "00:52:26", "text": "很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3148.47, "timestamp": "00:52:28", "text": "这真是个绝妙的组合。这是一个很棒的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3150.309, "timestamp": "00:52:30", "text": "组合。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3153.99, "timestamp": "00:52:33", "text": "这是。这很好。你知道，总是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3156.23, "timestamp": "00:52:36", "text": "每次你吃东西的时候都会这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3158.39, "timestamp": "00:52:38", "text": "用晶片的时候，一定要吮吸这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3160.19, "timestamp": "00:52:40", "text": "晶圆。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3164.23, "timestamp": "00:52:44", "text": "啊，总是那么美好。我得到了这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3166.15, "timestamp": "00:52:46", "text": "来自 Zeppto。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3168.79, "timestamp": "00:52:48", "text": "尺寸和我预想的差不多，不过还不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3170.829, "timestamp": "00:52:50", "text": "这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3172.87, "timestamp": "00:52:52", "text": "好的。就像我在向你展示……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3175.51, "timestamp": "00:52:55", "text": "吃播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3177.75, "timestamp": "00:52:57", "text": "没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3179.51, "timestamp": "00:52:59", "text": "我吃这么多，我会留着以后吃。"}]